WEBVTT

00:23:26.163 --> 00:23:30.579
And so when I think of rumble, I think
of West Side Story, I think musicals,

00:23:30.579 --> 00:23:33.913
you know. And so to me, that's
where it came from.

00:23:34.121 --> 00:23:42.829
It came from this idea of a rumble in West
Side Story was part part argument,

00:23:42.829 --> 00:23:45.913
part dance, because, you know,
as a musical.

00:23:46.079 --> 00:23:50.538
So in our culture, where my
number one job is that as

00:23:50.538 --> 00:23:55.621
the kind of CEO of this organization that
I lead is to normalize discomfort,

00:23:55.954 --> 00:23:57.829
we onboard for discomfort.

00:23:57.829 --> 00:24:01.788
We teach you how to fail and get
back up when you are brand new